 null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2026-09-30T19:16:32.563781", "datastore_active": true, "description": "Includes information gathered by technical staff during the event response process. This may include investigation of a report and communication with responding organizations.", "format": "CSV", "hash": "0bdbed0895a749b9e219c152897069dc", "id": "4283c060-c22f-48f5-a75c-8bccf0c54a99", "last_modified": "2026-10-21T00:34:26.026890", "metadata_modified": "2026-10-21T00:34:41.346670", "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "FHAB Responses", "package_id": "ab672540-aecd-42f1-9b05-9aad326f97ec", "position": 4, "preview": true, "preview_rows": 14437, "resource_type": null, "size": 7142159, "state": "active", "total_record_count": 14437, "url": "https://publish.data.ca.gov/dataset/ab672540-aecd-42f1-9b05-9aad326f97ec/resource/4283c060-c22f-48f5-a75c-8bccf0c54a99/download/hab-responses_2026-10-20.csv", "url_type": "upload"}, {"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2026-09-30T19:16:32.563782", "datastore_active": true, "description": "Includes information from field-based monitoring and laboratory analysis results. Information can be associated with an entire case or an individual report. Due to limited resources for HAB event response, a substantial time delay is anticipated for upload of this information to the data system. To rapidly determine the investigation status of a report, refer to the web map at: https://mywaterquality.ca.gov/habs/where/freshwater_events.html/", "format": "CSV", "hash": "eabc063da18daffa1a758fa5ab56b3ac", "id": "9d4e1df4-0cd6-4165-9e63-effcafd9dccc", "last_modified": "2026-10-21T00:34:44.235478", "metadata_modified": "2026-10-21T00:34:52.191624", "mimetype": "text/csv", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "FHAB Results", "package_id": "ab672540-aecd-42f1-9b05-9aad326f97ec", "position": 5, "preview": true, "preview_rows": 2080, "resource_type": null, "size": 572231, "state": "active", "total_record_count": 208